<!doctype html>
<html lang="de">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>VDBS Icon Demo</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/icons/vdb-icons.css">
  <style>
    body{font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",sans-serif;margin:0;padding:2rem;color:#111827;background:#fffaf2}
    h1{margin:0 0 .5rem} h2{margin:2rem 0 1rem} p{max-width:900px;line-height:1.5}
    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(150px,1fr));gap:1rem}
    .card{background:#fff;border:1px solid #eee2d0;border-radius:1rem;padding:1rem;display:grid;gap:.75rem;place-items:center;min-height:110px;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(17,24,39,.06)}
    .name{font-size:.8rem;color:#6B7280;text-align:center;word-break:break-word}
    .row{display:flex;gap:1rem;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;margin:1rem 0}
    code{background:#fff;border:1px solid #eee2d0;padding:.2rem .35rem;border-radius:.35rem}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>VDBS Icon Demo</h1>
<p>Enthält 198 Icons und Aliase für UI, Kontakt, Vereinsportal, Bibliothekssoftware und Methodenverwaltung.</p>
<p>Beispiel: <code>&lt;svg class="vdb-icon vdb-icon--teal vdb-icon--md"&gt;&lt;use href="/assets/icons/vdb-icons.svg#icon-mail"&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</code></p>
